237	     * the owner's {@code ownerId}, the owner's current primary identifier (see
238	     * {@link #primaryIdentifier(Owner)}) under the {@code customerCode} key, the owner's derived
239	     * {@code membershipLevel}, and the {@code event} marker {@code 'OWNER_CREATED'}. Published to the
240	     * dedicated {@code AUDIT} logger so downstream consumers can react to owner creation structurally
241	     * rather than by parsing the free-form line.
