253	     * {@code OWNER_CREATED} event carries. Today that is the owner's {@code customerCode}; this is the
254	     * one seam that decides which field is primary, so when the customer code is later unified into the
255	     * member id it is enough to return the member id here for the event to carry it instead — the event
256	     * shape (a {@code customerCode} field holding the primary identifier) stays the same.
257	     *
